# The punches: hold SEL, and a black key punches while it is held (F#3 .. F#5: HALF DOUBLE STOP REVERSE REPEAT
# GATE GRAIN CRUSH SWEEP WASH WOBBLE). The white key below it held too: MORE; above: TWIST. White keys
# on their own still play. SEL pressed twice: the punches stay until SEL again. A chord plays under it all.
wait 300
midi 90 30 64
midi 90 37 64
midi 90 3c 64
wait 600
press SEL
expect page 16
key b0 down
wait 300
expect punch 1
expect punchbuf 0
# the whites beside it lit (F3, G3: there to be pressed), the other black pads dim
expect leds_dim 38970664
expect leds_lit 7
shot 00_half.png
# MORE (F3 below): two octaves down
key w0 down
wait 200
expect punchmod0 1
expect voices 3
shot 00b_half_more.png
key w1 down
wait 200
expect punchmod0 3
key w0 up
key w1 up
wait 100
expect punchmod0 0
key b0 up
wait 200
key b1 down
wait 300
expect punchbuf 1
shot 01_double.png
key b1 up
wait 200
key b2 down
wait 500
shot 02_stop.png
key b2 up
wait 200
key b3 down
wait 300
shot 03_reverse.png
key b3 up
wait 200
key b4 down
wait 700
expect punchbuf 4
shot 04_repeat.png
# MORE: the stutter (1/16), more copies
key w5 down
wait 500
expect punchmod4 1
shot 05_stutter.png
key w5 up
# a tone punch on top of a buffer one: both
key b7 down
wait 200
expect punch 272
shot 04b_repeat_crush.png
key b7 up
key b4 up
wait 200
key b5 down
wait 140
shot 06_gate.png
wait 70
shot 06b_gate.png
key w8 down
wait 300
expect punchmod6 2
shot 06c_gate_pattern.png
key w8 up
key b5 up
wait 200
key b6 down
wait 400
shot 07_grain.png
key b6 up
wait 200
key b7 down
wait 300
shot 08_crush.png
